nearshare (1.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * mDNS discovery + BLE trigger advertising/scanning for two-way Quick
    Share presence signalling.
  * UKEY2 key exchange, AES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 encrypted transfer
    framing, PIN confirmation on both ends.
  * GTK4/libadwaita GUI, `nearshare` CLI, and Nautilus right-click
    "Send with NearShare" integration.
  * Direct mode: ad-hoc WiFi hotspot fallback via NetworkManager when no
    WiFi network is shared with the peer.

 -- Dhiva Labs <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0530
